step Elaena, Witherbeard and Yashiro
  tip Into Dae'gun, north of the Cradle: the ruins of a Horde base, now held by demons. Elaena Moonwhisper and Witherbeard camp at its western edge; Yashiro, a blademaster, waits a little east of them. Doomguards (elites, levels 58-59) walk among the demons: pull carefully.
  accept 92960                          -- Elaena Moonwhisper: Siphoned Ephemeral Essence
  accept 95793                          -- Witherbeard: Stemming the Demon Tide
  accept 96959                          -- Yashiro: Blademaster's Bonfires

